## ANSWER FORMAT

| Type | Format | Example |
|------|--------|---------|
| Number | digits only | `2273.8` |
| Percentage | number + % | `12.34%` |
| Regression | [s, −i] | `[0.123, −0.234]` |

**Use Unicode minus (−) for negatives. `round()` uses conventional 0.5→up.**
